This repository is a derivative work.

`custom_components/electrasmart/` is a modified copy of the `electrasmart`
integration from Home Assistant Core:

    https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/2026.9.4/homeassistant/components/electrasmart

Home Assistant Core is Copyright its contributors and licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this repository).

Files `climate.py`, `config_flow.py`, and `const.py` are unmodified copies
of the originals. `manifest.json` has unchanged `requirements`/`domain`
fields, with only `name` and the required `version` key added (custom
integrations must declare a version).

`__init__.py` is a modified file: it adds one monkey-patch (and the logging
needed for it) to `ElectraAirConditioner.__init__` so a device missing the
`deviceToken` field in Electra's API response no longer crashes the whole
integration. The change is documented in a module docstring at the top of
the file, per the Apache License's requirement that modified files carry a
notice of the change. Everything else in the file is unchanged from the
original.

